{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"There is an existing TSEN2 term for pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 2B using HGNC:28422, and the requested parent `MONDO:0700092` is consistent. Because the requested label says “with or without thrombotic microangiopathy,” I’m treating thrombotic microangiopathy as a variable feature rather than making the new class a subclass of TMA."}}
